        "text": "## What changed in 0.8\n\n`Source.readString()` is now an extension in `kotlinx.io`, so `:kstore-file` needs an import, not a rewrite.\n\n### Plan\n\n1. Add the import to `FileCodec.kt`\n2. Revert the `readByteArray()` workaround\n3. Rerun `:kstore-file:jvmTest`\n\nThings that stay the same:\n\n- `SystemFileSystem` paths\n- `buffered()` on sources and sinks\n\n```kotlin\nimport kotlinx.io.readString\n\nval text: String = source.readString()\n```\n\n> The JVM tests passed locally before the bump, so any failure now is the migration.",
